# Wireframe: No-OP — Auth Cookie Migration

## Purpose & Flow Context

No wireframes needed. This change is a backend-facing auth refactor with zero UI impact. All changes are confined to the session store (`src/entities/session/model/store.ts`), auth types (`src/entities/session/model/types.ts`), and MSW handlers.

No screens are added, modified, or removed. The user-facing experience is identical.

See `user-flows.md` for the auth state transitions, and `specs/frontend/auth-cookie-migration.md` for the behavioural specification.
